 stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>r</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mi>θ</mi></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
