mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">{</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo>:</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">}</mo></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>The change of variables formula for plane polar coordinates states that</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"78\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-munder><mjx-row><mjx-base><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222C TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-base></mjx-row><mjx-row><mjx-under style=\"padding-top: 0.167em; padding-left: 0.152em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D437 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-under></mjx-row></mjx-munder><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cA0\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"